_paragraph\" >Crafted with extreme realism to create visually stunning and frightening worlds. Every environment is meticulously detailed to confront you with your worst nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access version of the game will include the Forest, with the remaining content coming between now and the full release.</p>",
